  "description": "A powerful, opinionated starter toolkit for building enterprise-grade microservices with .NET 8. Complete solution including Redis caching, RabbitMQ/Redis Pub-Sub messaging, Entity Framework with PostgreSQL, MongoDB, MediatR CQRS, JWT authentication, API versioning, Swagger documentation, and background services.",
